data: {"type": "assistant_msg", "ts": "2026-08-06T12:12:35.832018+00:00", "content": "**Investigation Summary: ce_branch24** (actual device name is lowercase `ce_branch24`)\n\n### Device Health \u2705 Normal\n- **Hardware**: Fan 3000 RPM, Power 69.13W, PSU 11.86V, Temp 29.1\u00b0C \u2014 all within spec [metrics:0][metrics:1][metrics:2][metrics:3]\n- **Optics (eth1 SFP)**: RX -6.17 dBm, Temp 36.9\u00b0C, TX Bias 28.1 mA \u2014 normal operating range [metrics:0][metrics:1][metrics:2] (xcvr query)\n\n### Interface Counters\n- **eth0 (ifIndex=2)**: Heavy throughput \u2014 9.7M in / 3.7M out octets; **1,785 input discards** and **87 queue drops** [metrics:8][metrics:17][metrics:26][metrics:6]\n- **eth1 (ifIndex=515)**: Light traffic (103K in / 78K out), no errors/discards [metrics:9][metrics:18][metrics:27]\n- **VRF interfaces** (CORP/VOICE): Receiving traffic (55K/53K in) but **zero outbound** \u2014 likely normal for branch termination [metrics:14][metrics:15][metrics:23][metrics:24]\n- **WireGuard (wg0)**: 920K in / 941K out \u2014 SD-WAN tunnel aggregate [metrics:16][metrics:25]\n\n### SD-WAN Tunnels \u2014 **Critical Finding on ce_hub2 Path**\n| Tunnel | Latency (ms) | Jitter (ms) | Loss % | Rekeys |\n|--------|--------------|-------------|--------|--------|\n| ce_hub1 | 95.0 | 52.2 | 0.33% | 332 |\n| **ce_hub2** | **110.3** | **1.4** | **47.95%** | **335** |\n| ce_hub3 | 105.6 | 58.8 | 0.18% | 426 |\n| ce_hub4 | 86.5 | 44.7 | 0.21% | 337 |\n| ce_hub5 | 84.9 | 44.4 | 0.16% | 319 |\n| ce_hub6 | 91.7 | 48.2 | 0.08% | 340 |\n\n**ce_hub2 tunnel shows 47.95% packet loss** \u2014 severe impairment [metrics:11][metrics:5][metrics:17]. All other tunnels healthy (<0.35% loss). Both CORP and VOICE VRF paths show `sdwan_path_active=1` for all hubs [metrics:0][metrics:1], but traffic on the ce_hub2 path will experience heavy loss.\n\nHigh rekey counts (319\u2013426) across all tunnels suggest frequent renegotiation, possibly due to keepalive instability or path MTU issues.\n\n### Topology Context\n- **Upstream (1 hop)**: `pe12` \u2014 MPLS core node, healthy (BGP established, OSPF up, 113 LSPs) [topo:pe12]\n- **Local hosts (1 hop)**: `h_branch24_corp`, `h_branch24_voice` \u2014 no metrics exposed [topo:h_branch24_corp][topo:h_branch24_voice]\n- **Sibling branches (2 hops via pe12)**: `ce_branch12`, `p23`, `p24` \u2014 all healthy [topo:ce_branch12][topo:p23][topo:p24]\n\n### Recommendation\n1. **Immediate**: Investigate the `ce_branch24 \u2194 ce_hub2` path \u2014 check underlay connectivity (MPLS/Internet), MTU, firewall/ACL drops, and hub-side counters on ce_hub2.\n2. **Monitor**: eth0 input discards (1,785) and queue drops (87) \u2014 may indicate burst congestion on the LAN-facing port.\n3. **Logs**: No events returned in the current window; widen the time range or check syslog/NetFlow for ce_hub2 path flaps."}

